==Description==
The '''Basic Crate''' is the simplest [[Crates|Crate]] in the game. This yields the most basic skins in the game, which, aside from a few exceptions, vary only in color. You are able to get duplicate skins from this crate, once you have unboxed all the available skins to you. Skins from this [[Crates|Crate]] can appear in the [[Daily Store]].

Each skin that can be gotten from the '''Basic Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the daily skin store. In the daily skin store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Coins|500}} coins, {{Color|Uncommon}} cost {{Coins|750}} coins and {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Coins|1,000}}. While no such skins currently exist, {{Color|Legendary}} skins would also cost {{Coins|99,999}}.

==Appearance==
{{Tabber
|Current
|The '''Basic Crate''' resembles the look of a wooden box which was sealed shut. It contains gold on the inside. On its top is the standard shipping symbol indicating which side is up. It was opened with a crowbar.
|Version 1
|The '''Basic Crate''' resembled the look of a cardboard box with tape to seal it shut. On its side was the standard shipping symbol indicating which side is up.
}}

