==Description==
The '''Deluxe Crate''' is a very prestigious crate. Like the [[Premium Crate]], it yields more advanced and aesthetically pleasing skins than the [[Basic Crate]]. You are unable to get duplicate skins from this crate, once you have unboxed all the available skins to you. Skins from this crate can appear in the daily shop.

Each skin that can be gotten from the '''Deluxe Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the daily skin store. In the daily skin store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Robux|255}}, {{Color|Uncommon}} skins {{Robux|360}}, {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Robux|360}} and {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Robux|560}}.

==Appearance==
{{Tabber
|Current
|The '''Deluxe Crate''' is a large futuristic black crate with yellow finishing and a golden chevron on the front. It is locked by a card reader. It contains multiple gold coins inside.
|Version 1
|The '''Deluxe Crate''' was a large black crate with yellow finishing and a golden chevron on the front. It was locked by two straps.
}}

