==Description==
The '''Ducky Crate''' is a crate that could have been purchased for {{Coins|3,000}} in the store. This crate yields fifteen duck-themed skins, containing nine returning skins from the [[Duck Hunt Event#Hunting Season Pass|Hunting Season]] and six new skins. Skins from this crate can appear in the [[Daily Store#Daily Skin Store|Daily Skin Store]].

Each skin that can be obtained from the '''Ducky Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the Daily Skin Store. In the Daily Skin Store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Coins|3,000}}, {{Color|Uncommon}} skins cost {{Coins|3,500}}, {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Coins|4,000}} and {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Coins|4,500}}.

The '''Ducky Crate''' is a wooden crate with a yellow duck head on top. The crate will go up into the air and do a spin, which opens it. Multiple quack sounds can also be heard while it is being opened.

